  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0817f6add1a6fe73e88effc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e024616ec7a2bf1c748a0e016d56f11053ca841cb2a9d941ddb2fa396dd0aba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8981cb126a39e2c23bc42e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是堪称一流的结果哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c059b181fccd6b52e56dc19fe6e5586c071782ec1655f1fa059caad29250f5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f6905c965bde7d664d5a7b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了，你也很尽力了嘛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d09d865c6e504fd0465972885f75430cc078a4cbf4f569d00a96dfd18930bd79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78c3cea1e5ead4679f058e0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c261f8470e6b951068e0d77063c43fa4dad0595f35b1742681492d1a2f963251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0b7911d6c3ccb4c6be3dd96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5b082f347573af1051558b56e48d3b78ae2dc9f4f89d6312a8e2e3e7d547bf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90a4df4d51bfcb440294b298",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "13180522437c6cc592057ba23d1c2eb12ca48b6af31de93222e093c1cd1301a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:900716541111e7096bd13828",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好棒啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "43afbadb52bc00da48587e7dd022be13d52fd603af0e27603df5e9bf24f7ac1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eb959daeefe69604c1c79c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cf3eef450f25ca7f9c454b895a583457c35aa18789822f9cda7a9d84d736fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:198055996bb298b198f213a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好",
      "source_fingerprint": "f867f34178594f891eb70a4260f62b1d9289cfa60394f9fee1cbbe4a8b4bf436",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edaff44c6f37d5ad8fc02c7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可能……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4eeeed9bdf25944a314605c9934384cb77239611045e3bc704c5ccc2f911886",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:053c5ad09484560fc08f1e45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d264d03e7d8e5c9efe5b7f7e0b00b44c8c02904342dffc94475681ccb9893872",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:931b8c2706606a454c1a450f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上场咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40c938506ee60c916a2da83f41466b1c7f147d2c4f1100b54dfc723ad9911548",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64eea1e0f6d5395e24e9f1a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ae5fadada86182168b0c959599937033e482ab31789a5ec716496999eb3e86e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51eb8971180525d54f08bc21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2045e127d0da20c28f97190f1b0e56261012feb7b72882c5eebf86f9e6bf0dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e153bf81d3b97a52ed0edfc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天好像可以拿到这个呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b50dd9ea584035c95a171fa1796d9a1303803a9ba907ddfa1517c78438cee4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1789bfe19e46d65a0e3fcc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唉，圣王的脚竟然\r\n没办法灵活地活动……\r\n真是晴天霹雳……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a1d0c5eee86c98a9895855d320cbfa42ad04e771e82eece0761943b33be977e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f571e9d7e75557b8579acf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一流的赛马娘连休息\r\n都不会疏忽怠慢的。\r\n……你也要明白这点才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e466e9d4c06b41091b72f6f57b166eea1c6e69f9cd561f38649cf660da9c8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:382d197d5a1564914f15afe1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦ー吼吼吼！\r\n没有什么是我圣王办不到的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54c3e663d41f3712dbd1f818464679f390e14a763ad849fb7cf4ad37283d9d92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34cffa266b4884a2d9489edd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵呵，心情真好！\r\n现在就赋予你向一流的圣王\r\n提出一流指示的权利吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d641ed40ea7e3351175749052ace73a1b657d8cf17af875882f950c308c28572",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afabf2becb29a6e7833b9166",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，我赋予你公布今天行程的权利！\r\n向我提出最完美的建议吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "735e24ff457362184f859cc79fdbc86ac095f84e2d9c6ba4420dc72b3a44975d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16dd86ed76c8d7978bd8f15a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了提升圣王才能的时间了！\r\n你可要好好动用你的头脑才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbf0ecbf2013785b33cc729b5118d1702a243e411aa4b0c1c5bd075cf228de26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8da19db692dfc691420b1f4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所以呢？我该做些什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b40cd3e7e1d954b40ca1028cbcb9b30b55bf5138d1f91624684b6e1a177440c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:400ed266de362cf35ccd0db3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快，要开始训练了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91155856acf738951728c9695da2a31fb0f0d02c359bf7e05cf7cfc38abe4476",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ee5eabc8649c8a7567312f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……不行，没办法保持集中力。\r\n看来无论圣王再完美，\r\n都还是需要转换心情呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9fa1f32af779051baba459974075c8ace9bdd3d1c34569f35bfb28c82dc0206",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6a15d06ffc16dd2ab03ea0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "签约赛马娘的情绪管理\r\n也是你的工作吧。\r\n喂，做点什么有趣的事情吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b603568e371b84271e6a168677dfeb2d50f1b00a9376b7271762c69453f65dd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7345e8577038dc5fb630f3da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我并不是不高兴什么的……\r\n只是心情上提不起劲而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "faee43b78a018d19eccd87cd21d69c3520b532f32b09e7fad15cb8575423837b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63d2ded1dc01099cda7df4f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……放弃这种事，\r\n我是绝不可能允许的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "527939e54083ff7dbc25ca83f66450c2f406b199545ff4d03a59f2c78e578c11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d77e1010a0f9b19349c564c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直参赛反而变得没办法\r\n发现自己的疲劳……\r\n这对繁忙的我来说可是一大问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ba28024a369cf57a2b3d08ad417a3e1dff0a2534d73159ea1df616cec3c8b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7a19e810582d53fff34cdaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要挑战是可以，\r\n但只知道一味地参赛是很愚蠢的。\r\n知道吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "af0807c2bc531dfccf9c99bcae8e14976713692dc6e406b4198c0bd5a780bb01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f49a9f9d3d60f3d67bae298",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦ー吼吼吼！\r\n除了我以外还有谁能拿第一名呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "05cca36999496619e3c427f335d1ae7f0977b0c6987543cf584526f7459f2bc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9c571ba95a915ba80b0494f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论对手是谁都不重要！\r\n因为赢的一定会是我圣王光环！",
      "source_fingerprint": "867aaedb3391ee72de472b72a729c5dd88970f7a9be075d01a5921cc0ac67df4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecf10df9a775a4ab157fd7ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态非常完美。\r\n要做的只是向大家展露我的才能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff8b099d1874c9e4610d79d667709012fef1fc614d2dd587f6c5c2663ceb1943",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c27df8e79d87544b8a194746",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，状态还不错。\r\n你就做好替我欢呼的准备吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c653e50e96ee4da5fb4b23adbf9324c441357e70bf99211615359b62924e61ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00cad463b18af047b7b40cc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体感觉很轻盈，\r\n也没有什么需要担心的地方。\r\n要做的只是华丽地拿下胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9ac391695219d822dffd08d137530424ca70781d990f3aeb73e54de3fc93177",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1ce025413f38f378b6baedc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我明白，比任何人背负着\r\n更多取胜期望的人是我──\r\n圣王光环！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5753aa5453a239cdd1c2169d5a48705f37a0e581ceeae4d6c31e782d08ca503c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8779a440d8fbf7e36aa03e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只需要跑出配得上\r\n圣王的成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d48d4bab22cf9d47ecc435a6d022b8ecd18f5b7e81489012cb127d258f1379fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4a5fea1645e03eb3b29d29d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一直都为了今天这个时刻而努力。\r\n我当然要去拿下胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f04a3829cb6df98ed305ec46edf622f72bd3744de1ea4581d174c2b82aa9d959",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f6e2cdcde389c080b0d36e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧，去向大家展示\r\n我一流的跑姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43909353f6caa0c804e62d660a7a8e21e92b6bf3398336d2f905f3cc3d0691a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24e86269b04cd015bebb3c8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟也不是无时无刻\r\n都能在万全状态下奔跑的……\r\n只能尽力做到最好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a8706aeaea31291714f409c5e7c716f3d4e1189a66f87eab2f4d8acb58609f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a253ccce537abdb10d5db4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这气氛真不好……\r\n但能将这样的气氛一扫而空\r\n才叫做一流！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64009b8cbc280a840926c83ba758e976eddaaea6fb57e57b69852b3c1693a405",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da0281f792a45ac5a8b2a512",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我、我才没有紧张！\r\n我当然是不会有问题的啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eb621efbc5da8d21bc76a7cc51514d88977176b8e1593c372c969412092e6c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f91dbd2841226f1726f2d0eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论任何时候都要全力以赴。\r\n……这才是我的做法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d54dad825daa94ad12de8536455ae5037ad7c18af944942141ae1c2c7b607f70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b7a440c4060dab6ea48aba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……什么也别说。\r\n我想要保持无心状态去迎战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96c1ea4c56cf544e9753faff59bf450802f59b2ff85966e8f271ac5e1c22e7f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aad83ece95b8f673e13f89c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我就是不想放弃所以才会在这里。\r\n……我一定能做到的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d665331d50e433a0ef12511d425f1ce65ce76ef4882b5cba330ea1d863cf639c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10fe4cebce2592dd2a09c469",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上场咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40c938506ee60c916a2da83f41466b1c7f147d2c4f1100b54dfc723ad9911548",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:869e889ef43187b778d31a62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看好吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d6c405d17a0c835f622b1fda2f009a29104dd775cd1c3269a39c052215931cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ced08255ac371cc071c74937",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当然！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8de9dab381200d6a5564afe676253d4fab8a122da24063cbb74fb60fafacf4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f823c476105e548d5aac90b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，这样啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec890b0c21db6edd3a69971a693be1e9d94f045e571ea1621d329782945b3ecc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6da415dfdddafb136f5861ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咕……",
      "source_fingerprint": "727c3d354aadc91e3ce724d2a41fcbc84234cc54a17162f2d8758e28db67d1cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f6433405559517fc77c9b97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯、嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6417fd0d18e8e3ee99b82f57f647775bcc568af106b868afd491b92375cc4c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5032d00d253bf0a9228a3bdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不错嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de117798903d1d85602351b7073cedf51e1b4d73cf1ffaa1f88d14d00e76df84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f1bc82ef6921ba7e7be25f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，也算是可以。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a13f8160557fdc6b94a64740ff849cbe8f1c91eb2d74ca622d8de4b8482ed12c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:413e7ab73b4a1c45c8a9f1f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可以赋予你继续当我\r\n签约训练员的权利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f328e1330ff67116d241e267fe8df0234ab0e82b719eed4ff84bb701a9f96961",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af8cdf7f1aa41b1fb96feda1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了，你也很尽力了嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddbdd89c2e371943eebed7132d5ba914111b68ae3340ef6ac5facc9e04133ba4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebfdbb4eb195b8c01e71aaa0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快，我会让你度过很有意义的时间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4de001bae4ae46fa61218005d7c1af47bf45fda927fa44cb12be9216daa1d72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ad6d5a06c86a1c4bea744a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你见识我的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c8a8192e4aab374ab0335b61928176e4ce3badab5581acdf86a9c7d0d1abd73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b3aec9fdbbb7c0049f6d961",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，轮到我们上场了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0e0da6d83ac116221fcd1132a2cecba0adaec23f065ec5f616516a6fcbfb3e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:060f0f1651634c21e646187a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了，你也很尽力了嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddbdd89c2e371943eebed7132d5ba914111b68ae3340ef6ac5facc9e04133ba4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5011e436df0bc55853fbc08f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我明白，\r\n比谁都更背负取胜期望的人是我──\r\n圣王光环！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1755f82ed3ba4e84ffad4cc9e43c49e952f70f6e6b126f8c03f810e9161ac2eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55b780749a76294be204498f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态非常完美。\r\n再来只需要向大家展露我的才能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bab7a3ad7631ecd97a225bd272d4a384275bdc2a0e979e75b2b116ec7098d0a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08662248cc5a45d042269382",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了，你也很尽力了嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddbdd89c2e371943eebed7132d5ba914111b68ae3340ef6ac5facc9e04133ba4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7276c7235d4cb4923e88872e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くわよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29f84fb5f08b6211a7f8f6ebd8a99dcb41bee219fccb31490930c5992bc93641",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80d187da114089879f7eda9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，我是无法满足于这个名次的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c746bba69378b644c9fa3ce7153ad56e4172b5a42c6ca252539da9d996dff40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb8c529b8425d399bde1c8cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成绩还可以，但我不打算止步于此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8f6f5dee289db9ff93602939d0080cec7b41018f1def6dcf01e3781886804e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc97dbcb0bb19603306f84c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……这代表我还有目标可以挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "345f5fd173d6d5d9582aa52e88080d020bd40c6a4b0b6c149053c319e8a78700",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7085521019a9695f62bfc66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我……圣王居然……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9c01909e6ee3c90578e415efc8a9d2979084d823bb080f61692c29db3fb0266",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15c20e307e455b1a6ebe795a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦ー吼吼吼！真不愧是圣王啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "599d299731cbc261af38cb637c77b3bc29aec1669fb10ad6af6bc916d6614592",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9cbd00418c3bf302976ff9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，这就是圣王的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "831f9e74675aede9ab2d6b6969039eaab89b59e243f719306d76cffaa58529bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53ff073bb9c2d41d158e4a66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢各位的声援！感谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70bf3cb5803465577fee258a983146139698efa2e7ee7528e204e6999f8169a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce80d81b055e17f64f509277",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，这就是圣王的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "831f9e74675aede9ab2d6b6969039eaab89b59e243f719306d76cffaa58529bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:126bef32b97b970052bf6ad7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝利で飾って、この衣装は完成するのよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7288a56ec174c53e3951fa4477d7b83fe87a9defce00714b6576c327bc5746f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64a829329e96c073762f3802",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふっ、これがキングの実力よ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "953fedb4f491814be78d8a878e5165847aca5ef8711ee14b5c09fa8fe921d1cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0098b2231250e5c307c0bdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上场咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40c938506ee60c916a2da83f41466b1c7f147d2c4f1100b54dfc723ad9911548",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12778e711ef9761672a5af8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝对不会放弃的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82170d926fe5403a0542058ea1f9fb93e3563bb2d232f6beb1fc8d03774c6ca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:551730041c2c6f52e7871964",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再盛大些、再华丽些！\r\n由圣王担任团长的应援团\r\n可是最一流的应援团喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eaf4befe11ac5f579d0df4e607ad0668389ac34aa7cec90ade1ae55f7a10c54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abe47ab90ca28e798e9b7f0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "起きてしまったことは\r\n仕方がない、けれど…“一流”の\r\n舞台だけは、諦めないわ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d6bc3ba1c8dcbae97aeec00b5f6dfb2d30e0966a57cf5fd4133ec4688a5e845",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aece5ba5fb8d0f2a31f65cdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，提高声量！！\r\n要喊啰！\r\n加油！加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8f9f2fd9ac204d246acb65215d10d0069e60ef020f83babfa5b64c0228a391c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88ed7336ad95f0496ed196df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算满身泥巴、就算满身汗水，\r\n那一天的川上……\r\n看起来仍是那么耀眼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78b450b5f38464bf97db496bbde13429b13b6bef66d5391494ba5274418046e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a8b11dbbf0a1d5e02ff0da8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝对不会放弃的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82170d926fe5403a0542058ea1f9fb93e3563bb2d232f6beb1fc8d03774c6ca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b09b192535e7c11f5fab6a48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的，怎么又来邀我\r\n去庆功宴啊……明明我都已经\r\n不是团长了……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fbae064160a2aab304faa69191af960269e3b275ddb2d43235fa1bd4ee88d15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "400010"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
